OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry throughout the
OL,6,Fdaytime with some good sunny spells
OL,7,Fbetween patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,8,FChance of the odd afternoon shower in
OL,9,Fsouth. Moderate winds, occasionally
OL,10,Ffresh around west coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with clear spells at
OL,13,Ffirst this evening. Turning cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight, with showery outbreaks of
OL,15,Frain spreading northeast, these heavy
OL,16,Ffor a time. Rather windy around west
OL,17,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
