OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy and windy with showery
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, becoming heavy and
OL,7,Fpersistent for some in the afternoon.
OL,8,FRisk of gales around western coasts.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,11,Fand breezy with variable cloud
OL,12,Famounts. Occasional patchy rain at
OL,13,Ftimes, but also plenty of dry weather,
OL,14,Fespecially across eastern areas
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
